simulate Sorter Running bit]]></Description></Member><Member Name="ZZZZZZZZZZSORTER47" DataType="SINT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="true" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"/><Member Name="INDUCTING" DataType="BIT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" Target="ZZZZZZZZZZSORTER47" BitNumber="0" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[BIT is ON if this sorter is inducting a tray at the entrance eye]]></Description></Member><Member Name="IS_PRESET" DataType="BIT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" Target="ZZZZZZZZZZSORTER47" BitNumber="1" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[Is sorter PRESET from CARTER MCP]]></Description></Member><Member Name="OK_TO_INDUCT" DataType="BIT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" Target="ZZZZZZZZZZSORTER47" BitNumber="2" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[BIT used to say it is OK to induct into the sorter]]></Description></Member><Member Name="ONE_SHOT1" DataType="BIT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" Target="ZZZZZZZZZZSORTER47" BitNumber="3" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[One Shot for Encoder]]></Description></Member><Member Name="ONE_SHOT2" DataType="BIT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" Target="ZZZZZZZZZZSORTER47" BitNumber="4" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[One Shot for Encoder]]></Description></Member><Member Name="ONE_SHOT3" DataType="BIT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" Target="ZZZZZZZZZZSORTER47" BitNumber="5" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[One Shot for Moving data from sorter to zpa]]></Description></Member><Member Name="ONE_SHOT_TRAY_COUNTS" DataType="BIT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" Target="ZZZZZZZZZZSORTER47" BitNumber="6" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[One Shot for Counting Trays going throught the Sorter]]></Description></Member><Member Name="PULSE_COUNTER" DataType="INT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[A counter used to signify a pulse was recieved]]></Description></Member><Member Name="PULSE_COUNTER_PREV" DataType="INT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[A PREVIOUS copy of the counter used to signify a pulse was recieved]]></Description></Member><Member Name="PULSE_INFO_FPM_PULSE_CNT" DataType="DINT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[Counts up by 1 everytime the encoder says it move]]></Description></Member><Member Name="PULSE_INFO_FPM" DataType="DINT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[Feet per minute the sorter is running]]></Description></Member><Member Name="ZZZZZZZZZZSORTER59" DataType="SINT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="true" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"/><Member Name="PULSE_INFO_FPM_PULSE_CNT_ONS" DataType="BIT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" Target="ZZZZZZZZZZSORTER59" BitNumber="0" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[One shot to add 1 to the FPM_PULSE_CNT]]></Description></Member><Member Name="PULSE_INFO_FPM_PULSE_CNT_END_ONS" DataType="BIT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" Target="ZZZZZZZZZZSORTER59" BitNumber="1" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[One shot that triggers the FPM calculation]]></Description></Member><Member Name="PULSE_INFO_MILLISECS_PER_PULSE" DataType="DINT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[The actual milliseconds between pulses]]></Description></Member><Member Name="PULSE_INFO_MILLISECS_PER_PULSE_TIMER" DataType="TIMER" Dimension="0" Radix="NullType" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[The TIMER used to record the actual milliseconds between pulses]]></Description></Member><Member Name="PULSES_TO_WAIT" DataType="INT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[The # of pulses to wait to give proper spacing for the rest of the inductions]]></Description></Member><Member Name="ZZZZZZZZZZSORTER65" DataType="SINT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="true" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"/><Member Name="RUNNING" DataType="BIT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" Target="ZZZZZZZZZZSORTER65" BitNumber="0" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[This sorter is running]]></Description></Member><Member Name="RUNNING_TIMER" DataType="TIMER" Dimension="0" Radix="NullType" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[Timer used to keep track of SORTER runtime in HOURS]]></Description></Member><Member Name="RUNNING_TIMER_DELAY" DataType="TIMER" Dimension="0" Radix="NullType" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[This sorter is running delay TIMER]]></Description></Member><Member Name="SCAN_AREA_SERIALNUM_BLK" DataType="DINT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[The SERIALNUM that occupies the SCAN AREA for this sorter when Sensor is Blocked]]></Description></Member><Member Name="SCAN_AREA_SERIALNUM_CLR" DataType="DINT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[The SERIALNUM that occupies the SCAN AREA for this sorter when Sensor is Clear]]></Description></Member><Member Name="ZZZZZZZZZZSORTER71" DataType="SINT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="true" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"/><Member Name="START_MOTORS" DataType="BIT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" Target="ZZZZZZZZZZSORTER71" BitNumber="0" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[Internal BIT to turn on the sorter belt]]></Description></Member><Member Name="START_TIMER" DataType="TIMER" Dimension="0" Radix="NullType" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[Timer for WARNING horn]]></Description></Member><Member Name="STOP_DELAY_FOR_ID" DataType="TIMER" Dimension="0" Radix="NullType" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[Debounce Timer to prevent trays from entering sorter without destination]]></Description></Member><Member Name="ZZZZZZZZZZSORTER75" DataType="SINT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="true" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"/><Member Name="TUB_DETECT_IO" DataType="BIT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" Target="ZZZZZZZZZZSORTER75" BitNumber="0" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[RAW IO INPUT for the Tub Detect or Over Height Sensor]]></Description></Member><Member Name="TUB_DETECT_SENSOR_ERROR" DataType="TIMER" Dimension="0" Radix="NullType" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[TIMER used to determine if we have a TUB DETECT SENSOR ERROR]]></Description></Member><Member Name="VFD_CMD_RUN_RESET" DataType="INT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[The INTEGER sent to the VFD for RUN and RESET (respectively) an ERROR]]></Description></Member><Member Name="VFD_CMD_SPEED" DataType="INT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[The INTEGER used to set the speed that the VFD should RUN]]></Description></Member><Member Name="VFD_STATUS_FAULT_RUN" DataType="INT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[The INTEGER recieved from the VFD, that tells us if it is FAULTED or RUNNING (respectively)]]></Description></Member><Member Name="UPDATE_EYE_ZPA_POS" DataType="INT" Dimension="5" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[The array of SENSOR that we use to track around a corner between sorters]]></Description></Member><Member Name="UPDATE_EYE_ZPA_POS_ONS" DataType="BOOL" Dimension="32" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[One shot used to capture its virtual position in an AUTO TUNE]]></Description></Member><Member Name="UPDATE_EYE_ZPA_LAST_REALIGN" DataType="DINT" Dimension="5" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[The last SERIAL NUMBER that we realigned at this SENSOR]]></Description></Member><Member Name="ZZZZZZZZZZSORTER84" DataType="SINT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="true" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"/><Member Name="NON_VFD_START" DataType="BIT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" Target="ZZZZZZZZZZSORTER84" BitNumber="0" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[Bit for hard OUTPUT used to start sorter when no VFD is present]]></Description></Member><Member Name="NON_VFD_RUNNING" DataType="BIT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" Target="ZZZZZZZZZZSORTER84" BitNumber="1" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[Bit for hard INPUT used tell us sorter is running when no VFD is present]]></Description></Member><Member Name="NON_VFD_FAULTED" DataType="BIT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" Target="ZZZZZZZZZZSORTER84" BitNumber="2" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[Bit for hard INPUT used tell us sorter is running when no VFD is present]]></Description></Member></Members></DataType>
      <DataType Name="STRING_20" Family="StringFamily" Class="User"><Members><Member Name="LEN" DataType="DINT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"/><Member Name="DATA" DataType="SINT" Dimension="20" Radix="ASCII" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"/></Members></DataType>
      <DataType Name="TRAY_TRACK" Family="NoFamily" Class="User"><Members><Member Name="Barcode" DataType="STRING_20" Dimension="0" Radix="NullType" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"/><Member Name="Zone" DataType="DINT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"/><Member Name="Seq" DataType="DINT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"/><Member Name="Valid" DataType="BOOL" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"/><Member Name="Timestamp" DataType="DINT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"/></Members></DataType>
      <DataType Name="ZPA" Family="NoFamily" Class="User"><Members><Member Name="CONFIG" DataType="ZPA_CONFIG" Dimension="0" Radix="NullType" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"/><Member Name="DEVICE_STATUS" DataType="SINT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[DNET Status of the node]]></Description></Member><Member Name="FULL_TIMER" DataType="TIMER" Dimension="9" Radix="NullType" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[Timer for Full Condition]]></Description></Member><Member Name="FULL_TIMER_FOR_CNT" DataType="TIMER" Dimension="9" Radix="NullType" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[Timer for Full Condition]]></Description></Member><Member Name="INPUTS" DataType="DINT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"/><Member Name="INPUTS_NET_STATUS" DataType="INT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[Network Inputs]]></Description></Member><Member Name="JAM_TIMER" DataType="TIMER" Dimension="9" Radix="NullType" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[Timer for Jammed Condition]]></Description></Member><Member Name="ZZZZZZZZZZZPA7" DataType="SINT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="true" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"/><Member Name="JOG" DataType="BIT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" Target="ZZZZZZZZZZZPA7" BitNumber="0" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[Request to JOG a ZPA NODE from GFX]]></Description></Member><Member Name="MOVE_TRAY_IN" DataType="TIMER" Dimension="9" Radix="NullType" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"/><Member Name="ZZZZZZZZZZZPA10" DataType="SINT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="true" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"/><Member Name="NETBIT_TO_UPSTREAM_MAIN" DataType="BIT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" Target="ZZZZZZZZZZZPA10" BitNumber="0" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"/><Member Name="NETBIT_TO_UPSTREAM_SPUR" DataType="BIT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" Target="ZZZZZZZZZZZPA10" BitNumber="1" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"/><Member Name="NETBIT_TO_DOWNSTREAM_MAIN" DataType="BIT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" Target="ZZZZZZZZZZZPA10" BitNumber="2" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"/><Member Name="NETBIT_TO_DOWNSTREAM_SPUR" DataType="BIT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" Target="ZZZZZZZZZZZPA10" BitNumber="3" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"/><Member Name="OUTPUTS" DataType="DINT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"/><Member Name="ONE_SHOT" DataType="BOOL" Dimension="32" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"/><Member Name="ZZZZZZZZZZZPA17" DataType="SINT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="true" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"/><Member Name="OUT_OF_SERVICE" DataType="BIT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" Target="ZZZZZZZZZZZPA17" BitNumber="0" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[Request to put ZPA OUT OF SERVICE]]></Description></Member><Member Name="SPACING_DEBOUNCE" DataType="TIMER" Dimension="9" Radix="NullType" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"/><Member Name="ZZZZZZZZZZZPA20" DataType="SINT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="true" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"/><Member Name="SPECIAL_COND_OK_TO_RELEASE" DataType="BIT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" Target="ZZZZZZZZZZZPA20" BitNumber="0" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[Use this bit to give this ZPA a special bit to release into next card]]></Description></Member><Member Name="SPECIAL_COND_MOVE_IN" DataType="BIT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" Target="ZZZZZZZZZZZPA20" BitNumber="1" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[Use this bit to give this ZPA a special bit to execute a MOVE-IN to our first zone]]></Description></Member><Member Name="STOP_DELAY_FOR_ID" DataType="TIMER" Dimension="9" Radix="NullType" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[Stop delay waiting for an ID from MotionTrac for a scan zone ZPA]]></Description></Member><Member Name="TRANSFER_TRAY" DataType="TIMER" Dimension="9" Radix="NullType" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"/><Member Name="TRANSFER_TRAY_FOR_SLUG" DataType="TIMER" Dimension="9" Radix="NullType" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"/><Member Name="TRANSFER_REQUEST" DataType="BOOL" Dimension="32" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"/><Member Name="TRAY_PRESENT_TIMER" DataType="TIMER" Dimension="9" Radix="NullType" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[Tray is present in Zone Timer]]></Description></Member><Member Name="TRAY_CLEAR_TIMER" DataType="TIMER" Dimension="9" Radix="NullType" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[Tray is clear of the Zone Timer]]></Description></Member><Member Name="UNIFORM_SPACING" DataType="TIMER" Dimension="9" Radix="NullType" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"/><Member Name="ZONE_HOURS" DataType="DINT" Dimension="9" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[Hours that this Zone has RUN]]></Description></Member><Member Name="ZONE_HOURS_TIMER" DataType="TIMER" Dimension="9" Radix="NullType" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[Hours that this Zone has RUN TIMER]]></Description></Member><Member Name="ZONE_HOURS_ONE_SHOT" DataType="BOOL" Dimension="32" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[Hours that this Zone has RUN TIMER ONE SHOT]]></Description></Member><Member Name="ZONE_STATUS" DataType="INT" Dimension="9" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[0 = Normal, 1 = Full,  2 = Jammed,  4 = Out of Service,   5 = 24V Power Loss, 6 = Comm's Loss,
20 = Jammed (Acknowledged)]]></Description></Member><Member Name="ZONES_FULL" DataType="INT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[Count of how many zones are Full]]></Description></Member><Member Name="ZONES_FULL_FOR_CNT" DataType="INT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[Count of how many zones are Full]]></Description></Member><Member Name="ZONES_JAMMED" DataType="INT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[Count of how many zones are Jammed]]></Description></Member><Member Name="ZONES_JAMMED_PREV" DataType="INT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[Previous Jammed Zone Count]]></Description></Member></Members></DataType>
      <DataType Name="ZPA_CONFIG" Family="NoFamily" Class="User"><Members><Member Name="ZZZZZZZZZZZPA_CONFIG0" DataType="SINT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="true" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"/><Member Name="IS_NOT_PART_OF_FOR_LOOP" DataType="BIT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" Target="ZZZZZZZZZZZPA_CONFIG0" BitNumber="0" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[When bit is OFF we use the for loop to control the zones]]></Description></Member><Member Name="MAPPING_TYPE" DataType="INT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[0 = REFLECTIVE TYPE    1 = DIFFUSED TYPE]]></Description></Member><Member Name="NUM_OF_ZONES" DataType="INT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[The number of zones in the ZPA]]></Description></Member><Member Name="ZZZZZZZZZZZPA_CONFIG4" DataType="SINT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="true" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"/><Member Name="PART_OF_FULL_COUNT" DataType="BIT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" Target="ZZZZZZZZZZZPA_CONFIG4" BitNumber="0" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[Include in total Full zones for inhibit new trays merging]]></Description></Member><Member Name="SENSOR_IO" DataType="SINT" Dimension="9" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[What I/O bit is the zones sensor wired to]]></Description></Member><Member Name="ZPA_NUM_UPSTREAM" DataType="INT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[Which ZPA number that feeds us]]></Description></Member><Member Name="ZPA_NUM_UPSTREAM_SPUR" DataType="INT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[Which ZPA number that feeds us]]></Description></Member><Member Name="ZPA_NUM_DOWNSTREAM" DataType="INT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[Which ZPA number that we feed]]></Description></Member><Member Name="ZPA_NUM_DOWNSTREAM_SPUR" DataType="INT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[Which ZPA number that we feed]]></Description></Member><Member Name="ZZZZZZZZZZZPA_CONFIG11" DataType="SINT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="true" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"/><Member Name="ZPA_CODE_RUN_TURBO_MODE" DataType="BIT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" Target="ZZZZZZZZZZZPA_CONFIG11" BitNumber="0" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[Turn this bit on if you are running all the ZPA using the FOR LOOP code and want TURBO MODE code enabled]]></Description></Member><Member Name="FED_BY_DIVERTER_SPUR_SIDE" DataType="BIT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" Target="ZZZZZZZZZZZPA_CONFIG11" BitNumber="1" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[Turn this bit ON when I am fed by a diverter and on the spur side]]></Description></Member><Member Name="FEEDS_MERGE_SPUR_SIDE" DataType="BIT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" Target="ZZZZZZZZZZZPA_CONFIG11" BitNumber="2" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[Turn this bit ON when I am feeding a merge on the spur side]]></Description></Member><Member Name="HANDFEED_INPUT" DataType="INT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[Set this to the actual input that the hand feed sensor is wired to]]></Description></Member><Member Name="UPSTREAM_INTERLOCK_INPUT" DataType="INT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[The Input that the interlock will be wired to for the upstream conveyor]]></Description></Member><Member Name="DOWNSTREAM_INTERLOCK_INPUT" DataType="INT" Dimension="0" Radix="Decimal" Hidden="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"><Description><![CDATA[The Input that the interlock will be wired to for the downstream conveyor]]></Description></Member></Members></DataType>
