01 INPUTS (PUSHER1, Pusher / divert) -> XFER01_INPUTS + ENET_INPUTS word + GSV module fault]]></Comment>,                <Text><![CDATA[[ADD(ZPA_IO_TMP,1,ZPA_IO_TMP) ,ADD(ZPA_CURR_NODE,1,ZPA_CURR_NODE) ,MOV(XFER01:I.Data,XFER01_INPUTS) ,MOV(XFER01:I.Data,ENET_INPUTS[ZPA_IO_TMP]) ,GSV(Module,XFER01,FaultCode,ENET_DEVICE_STATUS[ZPA_CURR_NODE]) ]]]></Text>,              </Rung>,              <Rung Number="9" Type="N">,                <Comment><![CDATA[DEVICE XFER02 INPUTS (ROTARY1, Rotary table) -> XFER02_INPUTS + ENET_INPUTS word + GSV module fault]]></Comment>,                <Text><![CDATA[[ADD(ZPA_IO_TMP,1,ZPA_IO_TMP) ,ADD(ZPA_CURR_NODE,1,ZPA_CURR_NODE) ,MOV(XFER02:I.Data,XFER02_INPUTS) ,MOV(XFER02:I.Data,ENET_INPUTS[ZPA_IO_TMP]) ,GSV(Module,XFER02,FaultCode,ENET_DEVICE_STATUS[ZPA_CURR_NODE]) ]]]></Text>,              </Rung>,              <Rung Number="10" Type="N">,                <Comment><![CDATA[DEVICE XFER03 INPUTS (POPUP1, Cross-belt pop-up transfer) -> XFER03_INPUTS + ENET_INPUTS word + GSV module fault]]></Comment>,                <Text><![CDATA[[ADD(ZPA_IO_TMP,1,ZPA_IO_TMP) ,ADD(ZPA_CURR_NODE,1,ZPA_CURR_NODE) ,MOV(XFER03:I.Data,XFER03_INPUTS) ,MOV(XFER03:I.Data,ENET_INPUTS[ZPA_IO_TMP]) ,GSV(Module,XFER03,FaultCode,ENET_DEVICE_STATUS[ZPA_CURR_NODE]) ]]]></Text>,              </Rung>,            </RLLContent>,          </Routine>,          <Routine Name="IO_ENET_OUTPUTS" Type="RLL">,            <Description><![CDATA[I/O mapping generated by L5X Studio: copy ENET_OUTPUTS words to each ZPAxx 1799ER group output word, and each XFERnn_OUTPUTS DINT to its device block output word (ENET word appended after the zone groups). 10 ENET words.]]></Description>,            <RLLContent>,              <Rung Number="0" Type="N">,                <Comment><![CDATA[SETUP ZPA_IO_TMP]]></Comment>,                <Text><![CDATA[SUB(CONFIG_ZPA.ENET_OFFSET,1,ZPA_IO_TMP);]]></Text>,              </Rung>,              <Rung Number="1" Type="N">,                <Comment><![CDATA[ZPA